msgid "How do I buy a product?"
msgstr "Ninawezaje kununua bidhaa?"

msgid "Browse products on Wingastock, open the product you are interested in, and use the available seller contact information to communicate directly with the seller."
msgstr "Vinjari bidhaa kwenye Wingastock, fungua bidhaa unayoipenda, kisha tumia taarifa za mawasiliano za muuzaji zilizopo kuwasiliana naye moja kwa moja."

msgid "How do I contact a seller?"
msgstr "Ninawezaje kuwasiliana na muuzaji?"

msgid "Open the product listing and check the seller contact options provided on the product page."
msgstr "Fungua tangazo la bidhaa na angalia njia za mawasiliano za muuzaji zilizotolewa kwenye ukurasa wa bidhaa."

msgid "How do delivery requests work?"
msgstr "Maombi ya usafirishaji yanafanyaje kazi?"

msgid "Submit the product details and your delivery information through a delivery request. You can then track the request status from your account."
msgstr "Wasilisha taarifa za bidhaa na taarifa zako za usafirishaji kupitia ombi la usafirishaji. Baada ya hapo unaweza kufuatilia hali ya ombi lako kupitia akaunti yako."

msgid "How do I remove a favorite product?"
msgstr "Ninawezaje kuondoa bidhaa kwenye vipendwa?"

msgid "Open your Favorites page and select the remove option on the product you no longer want to keep."
msgstr "Fungua ukurasa wako wa Vipendwa na chagua chaguo la kuondoa kwenye bidhaa ambayo hutaki kuihifadhi tena."

msgid "How do I update my profile?"
msgstr "Ninawezaje kusasisha wasifu wangu?"

msgid "Go to Account, open My Profile, and select the edit option to update your account information."
msgstr "Nenda kwenye Akaunti, fungua Wasifu Wangu, kisha chagua chaguo la kuhariri ili kusasisha taarifa za akaunti yako."

msgid "Is Wingastock free to use?"
msgstr "Je, kutumia Wingastock ni bure?"

msgid "You can browse marketplace listings and explore available products. Any applicable service or seller charges depend on the specific service."
msgstr "Unaweza kuvinjari matangazo ya bidhaa na kuchunguza bidhaa zinazopatikana. Gharama zozote za huduma au muuzaji hutegemea huduma husika."

