msgstr "Wingastock ni nini?"

msgid "Wingastock is an online marketplace where people can discover products from different sellers and connect directly with them."
msgstr "Wingastock ni soko la mtandaoni ambapo watu wanaweza kugundua bidhaa kutoka kwa wauzaji mbalimbali na kuwasiliana nao moja kwa moja."

