msgid "Seller Terms and Conditions"
msgstr "Vigezo na Masharti ya Muuzaji"

msgid "By registering as a seller on this platform, you agree to comply with the following Seller Terms and Conditions:"
msgstr "Kwa kujisajili kama muuzaji kwenye jukwaa hili, unakubali kuzingatia Vigezo na Masharti yafuatayo ya Muuzaji:"

msgid "Seller Information:"
msgstr "Taarifa za Muuzaji:"

msgid "You must provide accurate, complete and up-to-date information when creating and maintaining your seller account. You are responsible for keeping your account information secure."
msgstr "Ni lazima utoe taarifa sahihi, kamili na zilizosasishwa unapounda na kudumisha akaunti yako ya muuzaji. Unawajibika kuhakikisha taarifa za akaunti yako zinakuwa salama."

msgid "Legal Compliance:"
msgstr "Uzingatiaji wa Sheria:"

msgid "Sellers must comply with all applicable laws and regulations of Tanzania, including laws relating to businesses, consumer protection, taxation, product safety, intellectual property, advertising and electronic commerce."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima wazingatie sheria na kanuni zote zinazotumika nchini Tanzania, ikiwemo sheria zinazohusu biashara, ulinzi wa watumiaji, kodi, usalama wa bidhaa, haki miliki, matangazo na biashara ya kielektroniki."

msgid "Product Authenticity:"
msgstr "Uhalisi wa Bidhaa:"

msgid "All products listed must be genuine, legal and accurately described. Counterfeit, stolen, fake, illegally imported or misleading products are prohibited."
msgstr "Bidhaa zote zilizowekwa lazima ziwe halisi, halali na zielezwe kwa usahihi. Bidhaa bandia, zilizoibwa, feki, zilizoingizwa nchini kinyume cha sheria au zinazopotosha haziruhusiwi."

msgid "Product Information:"
msgstr "Taarifa za Bidhaa:"

msgid "Sellers must provide accurate product names, descriptions, specifications, sizes, colours, quantities, images and other information necessary for customers to make informed purchasing decisions."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima watoe majina ya bidhaa, maelezo, sifa, ukubwa, rangi, kiasi, picha na taarifa nyingine muhimu kwa usahihi ili wateja waweze kufanya maamuzi sahihi ya ununuzi."

msgid "Pricing:"
msgstr "Bei:"

msgid "Sellers are responsible for setting accurate prices and ensuring that advertised prices are honoured. Any applicable fees, delivery charges or other costs must be clearly disclosed to customers."
msgstr "Wauzaji wanawajibika kuweka bei sahihi na kuhakikisha bei zilizotangazwa zinazingatiwa. Ada, gharama za usafirishaji au gharama nyingine zinazotumika lazima zielezwe wazi kwa wateja."

msgid "Stock Availability:"
msgstr "Upatikanaji wa Bidhaa:"

msgid "Sellers must keep product stock information reasonably accurate. Products that are unavailable should be removed or marked as out of stock."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima waweke taarifa sahihi kuhusu upatikanaji wa bidhaa. Bidhaa ambazo hazipatikani zinapaswa kuondolewa au kuwekewa alama ya kuisha."

msgid "Orders:"
msgstr "Maagizo:"

msgid "Sellers are responsible for processing accepted orders within the required time and must not deliberately cancel orders without a valid reason."
msgstr "Wauzaji wanawajibika kushughulikia maagizo yaliyokubaliwa ndani ya muda unaotakiwa na hawapaswi kughairi maagizo kwa makusudi bila sababu halali."

msgid "Delivery:"
msgstr "Uwasilishaji:"

msgid "Sellers must package products appropriately and cooperate with the platform's delivery or collection procedures. Products should be delivered within the time communicated to the customer."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima wafungashe bidhaa ipasavyo na kushirikiana na taratibu za uwasilishaji au ukusanyaji za jukwaa. Bidhaa zinapaswa kuwasilishwa ndani ya muda ulioelezwa kwa mteja."

msgid "Product Quality:"
msgstr "Ubora wa Bidhaa:"

msgid "Products must correspond with their descriptions and must not be defective, unsafe or materially different from what was advertised."
msgstr "Bidhaa lazima zilingane na maelezo yake na zisiwe na kasoro, zisizo salama au tofauti kwa kiasi kikubwa na kile kilichotangazwa."

msgid "Returns and Refunds:"
msgstr "Marejesho na Marejesho ya Fedha:"

msgid "Sellers must comply with applicable consumer protection requirements and the platform's return, refund and dispute policies. Where a seller is responsible for an incorrect, defective or materially misrepresented product, the seller may be responsible for the applicable return or refund costs."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima wazingatie mahitaji yanayotumika ya ulinzi wa watumiaji pamoja na sera za jukwaa kuhusu marejesho, kurejesha fedha na migogoro. Ikiwa muuzaji anawajibika kwa bidhaa isiyo sahihi, yenye kasoro au iliyowasilishwa kwa taarifa zinazopotosha kwa kiasi kikubwa, muuzaji anaweza kuwajibika kwa gharama zinazohusiana na marejesho au kurejesha fedha."

msgid "Prohibited Products:"
msgstr "Bidhaa Zilizopigwa Marufuku:"

msgid "Sellers must not list products that are illegal, stolen, counterfeit, dangerous or otherwise prohibited by law or by the platform. Regulated products may only be sold where the seller has all legally required licences and permissions."
msgstr "Wauzaji hawapaswi kuweka bidhaa ambazo ni haramu, zilizoibwa, bandia, hatari au zilizopigwa marufuku na sheria au jukwaa. Bidhaa zinazodhibitiwa zinaweza kuuzwa tu ikiwa muuzaji ana leseni na vibali vyote vinavyotakiwa kisheria."

msgid "Intellectual Property:"
msgstr "Haki Miliki:"

msgid "Sellers must have the right to use product photographs, descriptions, trademarks, logos and other content uploaded to the platform. Sellers must not infringe another person's copyright, trademark, patent or other intellectual property rights."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima wawe na haki ya kutumia picha za bidhaa, maelezo, alama za biashara, nembo na maudhui mengine wanayopakia kwenye jukwaa. Wauzaji hawapaswi kukiuka hakimiliki, alama ya biashara, hataza au haki nyingine za miliki za mtu mwingine."

msgid "Customer Conduct:"
msgstr "Tabia kwa Wateja:"

msgid "Sellers must communicate with customers professionally and must not engage in harassment, discrimination, threats, deception or fraudulent activities."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima wawasiliane na wateja kwa njia ya kitaalamu na hawapaswi kushiriki katika unyanyasaji, ubaguzi, vitisho, udanganyifu au shughuli za ulaghai."

msgid "Off-Platform Transactions:"
msgstr "Miamala Nje ya Jukwaa:"

msgid "Sellers must not use customer information obtained through the platform to unlawfully redirect customers to unauthorized transactions or services outside the platform."
msgstr "Wauzaji hawapaswi kutumia taarifa za wateja walizopata kupitia jukwaa kuwaelekeza kinyume cha sheria kwenye miamala au huduma zisizoidhinishwa nje ya jukwaa."

msgid "Taxes and Licences:"
msgstr "Kodi na Leseni:"

msgid "Sellers are responsible for obtaining any business licences, permits, registrations and tax obligations applicable to their business and products."
msgstr "Wauzaji wanawajibika kupata leseni za biashara, vibali, usajili na kutimiza majukumu ya kodi yanayotumika kwa biashara na bidhaa zao."

msgid "Payments:"
msgstr "Malipo:"

msgid "Sellers must provide correct payment and payout information. Any applicable platform commissions, transaction charges or other agreed fees may be deducted from seller payouts."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima watoe taarifa sahihi za malipo na fedha wanazopokea. Kamisheni za jukwaa, gharama za miamala au ada nyingine zilizokubaliwa zinaweza kukatwa kwenye malipo ya muuzaji."

msgid "Fraud and Manipulation:"
msgstr "Ulaghai na Udanganyifu:"

msgid "Sellers must not create fake orders, fake reviews, manipulate ratings, misuse promotions, engage in payment fraud or otherwise attempt to manipulate the platform."
msgstr "Wauzaji hawapaswi kutengeneza maagizo ya uongo, maoni ya uongo, kudanganya ukadiriaji, kutumia vibaya matangazo, kufanya ulaghai wa malipo au kujaribu vinginevyo kuendesha mfumo kwa njia isiyofaa."

msgid "Customer Privacy:"
msgstr "Faragha ya Mteja:"

msgid "Sellers must protect customer information received through the platform and must only use such information for legitimate purposes connected with fulfilling the customer's order and complying with applicable law."
msgstr "Wauzaji lazima walinde taarifa za wateja wanazopokea kupitia jukwaa na wazitumie tu kwa madhumuni halali yanayohusiana na kutimiza agizo la mteja na kuzingatia sheria zinazotumika."

msgid "Platform Monitoring:"
msgstr "Ufuatiliaji wa Jukwaa:"

msgid "The platform may review listings, orders, complaints and seller activity to protect customers and maintain marketplace standards."
msgstr "Jukwaa linaweza kukagua bidhaa zilizowekwa, maagizo, malalamiko na shughuli za wauzaji ili kuwalinda wateja na kudumisha viwango vya soko."

msgid "Suspension or Termination:"
msgstr "Kusimamishwa au Kusitishwa:"

msgid "The platform may restrict, suspend or terminate a seller account where the seller violates these terms, applicable law, customer protection requirements or marketplace policies."
msgstr "Jukwaa linaweza kuzuia, kusimamisha au kusitisha akaunti ya muuzaji ikiwa muuzaji atakiuka masharti haya, sheria zinazotumika, mahitaji ya ulinzi wa wateja au sera za soko."

msgid "Disputes:"
msgstr "Migogoro:"

msgid "Sellers agree to cooperate in good faith with investigations, customer complaints and dispute-resolution procedures established by the platform."
msgstr "Wauzaji wanakubali kushirikiana kwa nia njema katika uchunguzi, malalamiko ya wateja na taratibu za kutatua migogoro zilizoanzishwa na jukwaa."

msgid "Changes to These Terms:"
msgstr "Mabadiliko ya Masharti Haya:"

msgid "These Seller Terms and Conditions may be updated from time to time. Sellers will be expected to comply with the version applicable to their use of the platform."
msgstr "Vigezo na Masharti haya ya Muuzaji yanaweza kusasishwa mara kwa mara. Wauzaji wanatarajiwa kuzingatia toleo linalotumika wakati wanapotumia jukwaa."

